 "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment. "}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le05ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le05ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le05ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Hello. What can I do for you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I would like to deposit some money.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Not a problem. Cash or a check?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Cash.", "id": 1, "time": "10", "image": "engenn3le05ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: How much are you depositing?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: $250.00.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Which account? Your checking or savings?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Checking.", "id": 2, "time": "13000", "image": "engenn3le05ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Okay. Would you like me to update your bankbook?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No, that's alright. Could you tell me what the balance of my checking account is?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Certainly. Wow, it's $1, 007, 500! Is this your account?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, it's mine.", "id": 3, "time": "25400", "image": "engenn3le05ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Would you like to transfer any of your money into your savings account?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not at the moment. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Alright. Can I do anything else for you today? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Actually, I received a pamphlet with my bank statement in the mail. I wanted to ask about that credit card.", "id": 4, "time": "47500", "image": "engenn3le05ob01re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "At the Bank"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "My Bank Account Number Is \u2026 "}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 5}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately explain information about interests, hobbies, and preferences in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation.Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "At the Bank"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A bank is a safe place to keep your money. The bank provides you with financial services (services related to money)."}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: How may I help you?<br>  <span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: I would like to open an account.<br>  <span class=\"strong\">Bank Teller</span>: Would you like to apply for a credit card also?<br>  <span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: No, thanks."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The people you talk to at the bank are called <span class=\"strong\">bank tellers</span>. They can help you with many things like:<br>  <ul><li>opening an account <li>depositing money into your bank account</li> <li>taking money out of your account</li> <li>cashing checks</li> <li>applying for a credit card</li></ul>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modals for Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use modals <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">can</span></span>, <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">could</span></span> and <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">may</span></span> to make requests in banks, shops, stores, etc. Making requests is one of the ways you interact with people when you need a service."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can I open an account?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could I speak to the manager, please?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "May I ask you a question?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "It is important to be polite when you make requests for a service. Use the words <span class=\"italic\">please</span> and <span class=\"italic\">thank you</span>."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to deposit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to put money in a bank "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like to deposit money into my account. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use at the bank."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "checking account"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bank account that you can take money out of at any time, and use checks to pay for things "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I would like to deposit it into my checking account."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "savings account"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bank account used to save money  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like to put money in your savings account?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "balance"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the amount of money you have in your bank account "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What is the balance in my account?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to transfer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to move money from one account into another "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'd like to transfer $100 into my savings account."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "statement"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a record that shows the money you pay, receive and owe "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here is a copy of your bank statement. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pamphlet "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a very thin book that gives information about a product or service"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I received a pamphlet about a credit card."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bankbook"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a book that shows the money you put into and take out of your bank account "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Would you like to update your bankbook?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le05ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le05ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Read each role card below and choose one."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the situation with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are the customer. You want to deposit money into your checking account. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2:</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You are the bank teller. You offer bank services to the customer.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I reject an offer."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I act out being a bank teller and a customer."}]}], "type": "sena"}